WEBVTT

1
00:12:56.550 --> 00:13:19.180
First – we bow to Shri Ganesha
because Shri Ganesha is the source of innocence

2
00:13:19.180 --> 00:13:21.089
within us.

3
00:13:21.089 --> 00:13:30.830
So actually we bow to innocence within us.

4
00:13:30.830 --> 00:13:44.220
And this innocence is the one [that] gives
you the enlightenment.

5
00:13:44.220 --> 00:14:00.480
As I told you yesterday the light has innocence,
but this is innocent without knowledge.

6
00:14:00.480 --> 00:14:07.130
But your light is innocent with knowledge.

7
00:14:07.130 --> 00:14:15.330
We always think that the people who have got
knowledge can never be innocent, can never

8
00:14:15.330 --> 00:14:17.820
be simple.

9
00:14:17.820 --> 00:14:25.900
And the idea we have got about innocence is
that a innocent person is always deceived,

10
00:14:25.900 --> 00:14:35.550
can be befooled – and can be always taken
for granted.

11
00:14:35.550 --> 00:14:49.300
But innocence is a power; it is a power which
protects you, which gives you light of knowledge.

12
00:14:49.300 --> 00:15:01.860
Knowledge that we have in the worldly sense
is how to exploit others, how to cheat others,

13
00:15:01.860 --> 00:15:16.750
how to make money out of them, how to make
fun of others, how to look down upon others.

14
00:15:16.750 --> 00:15:26.150
But the light of innocence is the light by
which you know that love is the highest thing.

15
00:15:27.740 --> 00:15:38.140
And it teaches you how to love others, how
to care for others, how to be gentle about

16
00:15:38.140 --> 00:15:39.250
others.

17
00:15:39.250 --> 00:15:42.750
It also gives you the light within.

18
00:15:42.750 --> 00:15:48.410
It’s just the other way round of this avidya
that we have in this world.

19
00:15:48.410 --> 00:15:51.179
Just the other way round.

20
00:15:51.179 --> 00:16:06.670
The avidya outside teaches us competition,
how to put the other person down.

21
00:16:06.670 --> 00:16:13.890
Because it has fear, it is insecured.

22
00:16:13.890 --> 00:16:19.539
This knowledge is not secured – at all.

23
00:16:19.539 --> 00:16:26.480
If it had security it would not have behaved
like this.

24
00:16:26.480 --> 00:16:31.580
But the light of innocence knows everything.

25
00:16:34.280 --> 00:16:36.740
It has no fear.

26
00:16:36.740 --> 00:16:45.510
When we say ‘children are innocent’ we
mean to say that they have that power of innocence.

27
00:16:45.510 --> 00:16:54.310
Many times people have noticed if a child
falls from a height, it doesn’t die; while

28
00:16:54.310 --> 00:17:01.789
a young man may die with a much smaller height.

29
00:17:01.789 --> 00:17:03.950
And the child is not afraid while falling.

30
00:17:03.950 --> 00:17:13.790
He just enjoys, as if there is a parachute
coming down, you know, nicely.

31
00:17:13.870 --> 00:17:18.240
And then when he falls down, also he just
gets up, laughs, smiles at everyone.

32
00:17:18.240 --> 00:17:24.050
He doesn’t understand why everybody is worried.

33
00:17:24.050 --> 00:17:30.319
Because in that innocence he knows that he’s
looked after, he’s protected.

34
00:17:30.319 --> 00:17:40.309
He knows that there is a power, which is much
higher than him and he does not have to worry.

35
00:17:40.309 --> 00:17:48.199
Then we start putting ideas into the head
of the child, and that is how he starts losing

36
00:17:48.199 --> 00:18:01.659
his power of innocence and he becomes a coward,
he becomes a cunning fellow, he becomes an

37
00:18:01.659 --> 00:18:08.659
unrighteous personality.

38
00:18:08.659 --> 00:18:18.819
But still we would say that the innocence
of children is [the] innocence of ignorance,

39
00:18:18.819 --> 00:18:26.969
in a way, because they do not know the dangers
of life.

40
00:18:26.969 --> 00:18:40.059
But the light of innocence knows all the dangers,
and also knows how to get rid of it, also

41
00:18:40.059 --> 00:18:44.540
knows how to be away from such a person.

42
00:18:47.267 --> 00:19:00.639
There was a wise man, who was going on a staircase,
and there was a stupid man coming from the

43
00:19:00.639 --> 00:19:03.880
other side – foolish man.

44
00:19:03.880 --> 00:19:10.039
So foolish people are always aggressive, that
is one of the signs, because they have inferiority

45
00:19:10.039 --> 00:19:11.759
complex.

46
00:19:11.759 --> 00:19:18.630
So the foolish man says to the man who was
coming up, he says – [because] one had to

47
00:19:18.630 --> 00:19:24.169
move on one side – so he says, “I don’t
move for fools!”

48
00:19:24.169 --> 00:19:27.919
The foolish one says.

49
00:19:27.919 --> 00:19:35.180
So the wise man says, “I do,” and he moved.

50
00:19:40.470 --> 00:19:48.491
That’s how the light of innocence
tells you how far to go with a person, how

51
00:19:48.491 --> 00:19:58.189
far to talk to a person, how far to indulge
in another person’s personality or his problems;

52
00:19:58.189 --> 00:20:00.719
otherwise he recedes.

53
00:20:00.719 --> 00:20:05.909
He understands that this gentleman is a stupid
fool so “I move for a fool like that.”

54
00:20:05.909 --> 00:20:13.899
He doesn’t pay attention to such a person,
he doesn’t bother about such a person.

55
00:20:13.899 --> 00:20:19.899
This is the light of innocence which gives
you discrimination.

56
00:20:19.899 --> 00:20:21.289
How far to go with others.

57
00:20:21.289 --> 00:20:25.689
I love a person, there are many, “I love
him”.

58
00:20:25.689 --> 00:20:26.689
Alright!

59
00:20:26.689 --> 00:20:32.649
The another person may kick you, may hit you,
may trouble you, may become absolutely horribly

60
00:20:32.649 --> 00:20:42.460
possessed, but still you are just mad in love
with that person, without any self-respect.

61
00:20:42.460 --> 00:20:49.309
This comes because there is no…you may be
innocent, in a way, in a worldly manner, but

62
00:20:49.309 --> 00:20:51.770
you are not enlightened and innocent.

63
00:20:51.770 --> 00:20:59.229
When you are enlightened and innocent then
your innocence is a power, which gives you,

64
00:20:59.229 --> 00:21:04.889
first thing, is discretion.

65
00:21:04.889 --> 00:21:11.539
Supposing you take a light in your hand – now
you know whether it is a snake or a rope,

66
00:21:11.539 --> 00:21:15.479
but if there is no light in your hand, you
cannot see.

67
00:21:15.479 --> 00:21:21.849
But even, supposing it’s a snake, you might
run away, or if you are a stupid fool, you’ll

68
00:21:21.849 --> 00:21:23.469
say, “Alright, come and bite me.

69
00:21:23.469 --> 00:21:30.880
I would like to see, how it works.”

70
00:21:37.270 --> 00:21:44.120
But if you are an enlightened person,
then you will tell the snake, “Now, let

71
00:21:44.120 --> 00:21:45.340
me be alone.

72
00:21:45.340 --> 00:21:46.340
Alright?

73
00:21:46.340 --> 00:21:47.340
Bye-bye.”

74
00:21:47.340 --> 00:21:51.810
And the snake will know and it
will go away.

75
00:21:51.810 --> 00:22:00.340
Or if the snake is a sinister one, you may
just look at the snake and snake might run

76
00:22:00.340 --> 00:22:01.490
off.

77
00:22:01.490 --> 00:22:10.090
So this power of innocence is a very, very
important thing, and that comes to us through

78
00:22:10.090 --> 00:22:13.680
our enlightenment alone.

79
00:22:13.680 --> 00:22:25.300
So we are, say, in a state which is ignorant
and innocent – innocent and ignorant.

80
00:22:25.300 --> 00:22:32.390
Then people are no more innocent nor ignorant,
but they are not enlightened – they become

81
00:22:32.390 --> 00:22:33.390
cunning!

82
00:22:35.117 --> 00:22:41.110
If they don’t have both the qualities – they
are neither ignorant, so-called, they have

83
00:22:41.110 --> 00:22:47.730
got knowledge, they are good at everything,
they are well known people, for their intelligence,

84
00:22:47.730 --> 00:22:51.410
brilliance, everything – so they are knowledgeable,
so-called.

85
00:22:51.410 --> 00:22:58.310
So such people we could call as the people
who have got the knowledge, in the worldly

86
00:22:58.310 --> 00:23:03.320
sense, but they have no innocence.

87
00:23:03.320 --> 00:23:08.940
So they start devising methods, the innocence
which is there, which puts a little control

88
00:23:08.940 --> 00:23:12.750
over such a mind, is lost.

89
00:23:12.750 --> 00:23:14.710
Because they think innocence is stupid, you
know?

90
00:23:14.710 --> 00:23:16.850
They don’t respect their innocence.

91
00:23:16.850 --> 00:23:23.850
So they start manoeuvring people, doing violent
things, doing harmful things, saying nasty,

92
00:23:23.850 --> 00:23:25.110
sarcastic things.

93
00:23:25.110 --> 00:23:33.780
All these things the brain starts working,
because it cannot get back to its innocence.

94
00:23:33.780 --> 00:23:37.240
So we don’t like such people later on, we
don’t want them.

95
00:23:37.240 --> 00:23:44.200
Then they develop ideas that, “We are higher
people, we are chosen people, we are better

96
00:23:44.200 --> 00:23:46.520
people,” then – they develop all these
ideas.

97
00:23:46.520 --> 00:23:49.670
Then they, all of them club together.

98
00:23:49.670 --> 00:23:55.890
So ignorance is added as a so-called knowledge,
you see.

99
00:23:55.890 --> 00:24:00.500
Inside is completely ignorance, outside is
knowledge.

100
00:24:00.500 --> 00:24:07.740
And added up – added up like that, they
do not want to seek their inside.

101
00:24:07.740 --> 00:24:15.520
And they are satisfied with their outside,
so-called knowledge.

102
00:24:15.520 --> 00:24:20.700
And they go ahead with it, and once they break
their heads, then they realise, “Oh God,

103
00:24:20.700 --> 00:24:21.970
what was it?

104
00:24:21.970 --> 00:24:26.160
Inside is all darkness.”

105
00:24:26.160 --> 00:24:37.270
We cannot live with all the windows closed
hermetically and the sun shining outside.

106
00:24:37.270 --> 00:24:47.870
We have to have light inside, to see for ourselves,
what are we, what are our powers, how far

107
00:24:47.870 --> 00:24:56.600
we can go, how we are working out ourselves,
our lives, our aims?

108
00:24:56.680 --> 00:25:08.880
Now the enlightenment, as the enlightenment
you see here is of these lights, is manifested

109
00:25:08.880 --> 00:25:18.650
within you as vibrations, as chaitanya, as
light.

110
00:25:18.650 --> 00:25:23.770
So the chaitanya itself is the light.

111
00:25:23.770 --> 00:25:31.780
But the difference between this light and
that light is such that this one will only

112
00:25:31.780 --> 00:25:36.400
tell you as far as your eyes are concerned.

113
00:25:36.400 --> 00:25:44.560
It will tell you that it is a stone, or it
is a wood, or it is a house, or it is a face

114
00:25:44.560 --> 00:25:54.960
of a man – anything, this light, but it
won’t be able to tell you whether this person

115
00:25:54.960 --> 00:26:03.650
is good or bad, whether this house is vibrated
or not, is auspicious or not.

116
00:26:03.650 --> 00:26:07.960
So it doesn’t give you auspiciousness, the
idea of auspiciousness.

117
00:26:07.960 --> 00:26:13.680
So we are talking of Ganesha’s innocence,
which gives us sense of auspiciousness, and

118
00:26:13.680 --> 00:26:20.400
ourselves also makes us auspicious.

119
00:26:20.400 --> 00:26:34.600
This is how the chaitanya itself is enlightenment,
chaitanya itself is enlightenment.

120
00:26:34.600 --> 00:26:41.470
It relates to you all the knowledge which
it has.

121
00:26:41.470 --> 00:26:49.360
Now imagine what a micro-arrangement it is
that the chaitanyas, which are small, small

122
00:26:49.360 --> 00:26:58.140
like, we can say, little round valayas, small,
small ones.

123
00:26:58.140 --> 00:27:09.700
They have intelligence in them, and discretion
built-in them to tell you whether a person

124
00:27:09.700 --> 00:27:14.670
is good or bad.

125
00:27:14.670 --> 00:27:18.780
You have got it, Sahaja Yoga, so in a simple
way.

126
00:27:18.780 --> 00:27:24.930
So we have not bothered to find out, what
your computer has got.

127
00:27:24.930 --> 00:27:34.370
It has got the knowledge now to know, not
only if the person is good or bad, but what

128
00:27:34.370 --> 00:27:37.740
troubles that person has got.

129
00:27:37.740 --> 00:27:50.120
Now this light can go up to one dimension
of a person, how he looks, how he walks, everything.

130
00:27:50.120 --> 00:28:02.590
And you, if you start imagining something,
if you start imagining – and saying that,

131
00:28:02.590 --> 00:28:06.140
“I feel this way, I think this way.”

132
00:28:08.470 --> 00:28:11.370
Shri Mataji: not all right?

133
00:28:12.170 --> 00:28:14.370
Yogini: [inaudible]

134
00:28:15.720 --> 00:28:16.720
Shri Mataji: Ha?

135
00:28:16.720 --> 00:28:17.720
Yogini: [inaudible]

136
00:28:17.720 --> 00:28:19.360
Shri Mataji: You can’t hear Me?

137
00:28:19.360 --> 00:28:20.680
Many yogis: Yes.

138
00:28:20.680 --> 00:28:23.320
Upstairs only in the baby school.

139
00:28:29.170 --> 00:28:30.470
Shri Mataji: What is it?

140
00:28:30.550 --> 00:28:34.470
Akbar: There is a video for the mothers with
the children, and they can’t hear You.

141
00:28:34.570 --> 00:28:36.270
It is upstairs.

142
00:28:40.670 --> 00:28:42.870
Shri Mataji: I didn’t hear, what is it?

143
00:28:42.970 --> 00:28:46.990
Antonio Scialo: There is a children-room upstairs,
for children, with a video for children and

144
00:28:47.070 --> 00:28:48.170
mothers.

145
00:28:48.250 --> 00:28:49.870
But they cannot hear it.

146
00:28:52.770 --> 00:28:55.670
Shri Mataji: Oh I see, but the children are
here?

147
00:28:55.770 --> 00:28:58.970
Yogis: Babies, babies; mothers and babies.

148
00:28:59.470 --> 00:29:01.670
Shri Mataji: Oh God.

149
00:29:03.570 --> 00:29:07.470
Somebody has to go up and fix it up, isn’t
it?

150
00:29:20.970 --> 00:29:25.470
I think you should have tested it before,
isn’t it?

151
00:29:28.520 --> 00:29:30.450
Alright.

152
00:29:38.386 --> 00:29:46.900
So, the chaitanya that is within us, which
is flowing out, which we are receiving from

153
00:29:46.900 --> 00:30:04.529
all over, is all-pervading, is in every molecule
pulsating: which gives us knowledge about

154
00:30:04.529 --> 00:30:13.129
each and every matter, each and every animal,
each and every human being, and each and every

155
00:30:13.129 --> 00:30:16.989
Deity.

156
00:30:19.111 --> 00:30:27.629
Without this light you could not have recognised
Me.

157
00:30:27.629 --> 00:30:32.220
You could not have recognised any Deities.

158
00:30:32.220 --> 00:30:39.720
You could not have known your position in
life and your aims in life.

159
00:30:39.720 --> 00:30:46.219
You would not have known what is your purpose
of life, why are you here.

160
00:30:46.219 --> 00:30:51.190
Are you here just to make some money, put
some in the insurance, some in the shares?

161
00:30:51.270 --> 00:30:53.340
Of course, now nobody will do that!

162
00:30:53.420 --> 00:30:55.670
(The stock markets crashed on Monday 19 October
1987 the week of this puja)

163
00:30:55.750 --> 00:31:04.080
And get some house, and dance on the fingers of
your wife, or the wife has to dance as the

164
00:31:04.080 --> 00:31:13.089
dictates of the husband, to bring up children
somehow – are you here for that?

165
00:31:13.089 --> 00:31:19.969
This chaitanya tells you, very clearly, “No.”

166
00:31:19.969 --> 00:31:32.210
Because if you get more involved into these
things and become completely cut-off from

167
00:31:32.210 --> 00:31:38.479
the collective happenings, then this light
goes off.

168
00:31:38.479 --> 00:31:46.999
As soon as this light gets disconnected, you
can’t have any light.

169
00:31:46.999 --> 00:32:02.210
So, any connection, whatever you have, with
the vibrations has to be very strong, and

170
00:32:02.210 --> 00:32:05.330
has to be absolutely intact and steady.

171
00:32:05.330 --> 00:32:10.450
For example, if there is a light which is
not steady, which is moving, you can’t understand

172
00:32:10.530 --> 00:32:15.519
things properly.

173
00:32:15.519 --> 00:32:24.479
Though the vibrations know everything, but
how will they communicate this to an instrument

174
00:32:24.479 --> 00:32:41.649
which is not perfect, which does not respect
vibrations, which does not communicate with

175
00:32:41.649 --> 00:32:46.410
the vibrations?

176
00:32:46.410 --> 00:32:48.160
Please take the child out.

177
00:32:48.160 --> 00:32:52.649
Don’t try to push the – no, no, no, don’t
do that.

178
00:32:52.649 --> 00:32:54.200
No, no, don’t.

179
00:32:54.200 --> 00:32:56.810
You should not lose temper with children,
you know?

180
00:32:56.810 --> 00:33:00.970
They are crying, they must be wanting something.

181
00:33:28.170 --> 00:33:36.129
So, this knowledgeable instrument that you
have got is to be all the time flowing through

182
00:33:36.129 --> 00:33:41.690
you, and you have to be a very clean apparatus.

183
00:33:41.690 --> 00:33:52.720
Supposing you have this light, and the glass
is not clean – you won’t get light properly.

184
00:33:52.720 --> 00:34:03.690
So the purity has to be established, and that
is the part, where Ganesha is so important,

185
00:34:03.690 --> 00:34:13.749
because He cleanses you, He washes you and
you become innocent: because you do not plan

186
00:34:13.749 --> 00:34:22.389
or think of harming anyone, who is a good
person, who is a nice person.

187
00:34:22.389 --> 00:34:28.540
It becomes innocence because it is auspicious.

188
00:34:28.540 --> 00:34:30.830
You start becoming auspicious.

189
00:34:30.830 --> 00:34:38.320
Wherever you go, and [if] you meet somebody
that person feels, “Oh God, today something

190
00:34:38.320 --> 00:34:40.509
good has happened in our family.

191
00:34:40.509 --> 00:34:43.769
Something good has come out.”

192
00:34:43.769 --> 00:34:50.749
Now recently I met someone in Germany where
there was a ‘sahaja yogi’ who started

193
00:34:50.749 --> 00:34:54.440
talking against Me and Sahaja Yoga.

194
00:34:54.440 --> 00:35:01.759
And he got out of the Ashram, and then he
went to somebody who was supposed to be a

195
00:35:01.759 --> 00:35:06.769
sahaja yogi, and his wife, and there he started
telling about his woes and, against Sahaja

196
00:35:06.769 --> 00:35:09.379
Yoga and all those things.

197
00:35:09.379 --> 00:35:14.719
Though he has been always a possessed man,
but still: these people should not have listened

198
00:35:14.719 --> 00:35:16.410
to anything against Me.

199
00:35:16.410 --> 00:35:23.210
In the shastras is written, that: to hear
the Guru-ninda, anything against your Guru,

200
00:35:23.210 --> 00:35:25.859
is absolutely dangerous.

201
00:35:25.859 --> 00:35:30.279
So anybody says anything against your Guru,
you have to put your hands like that, “I

202
00:35:30.279 --> 00:35:33.499
don’t want to hear anything against my Guru!”

203
00:35:33.499 --> 00:35:34.930
Instead of that they sympathised.

204
00:35:34.930 --> 00:35:44.120
So the lady has got a serious type of cancer,
and the husband is also very sick.

205
00:35:44.120 --> 00:35:54.110
Now, one has to understand that if you are
going to cross this ocean in a boat – all

206
00:35:54.110 --> 00:36:01.920
of us are there – and [if] one wants to
put one foot into the mouth of a crocodile,

207
00:36:01.920 --> 00:36:03.920
how can we save such people?

208
00:36:03.920 --> 00:36:10.580
Then it’s better that they should go to
the crocodile than to the boat.

209
00:36:10.580 --> 00:36:18.700
But those who try to sympathise and put another
foot in the crocodile, then they have to be

210
00:36:18.700 --> 00:36:25.700
in trouble.

211
00:36:25.700 --> 00:36:32.119
All these things not only hamper but are so
inauspicious and dangerous that you all have

212
00:36:32.119 --> 00:36:37.680
to be extremely careful about it.

213
00:36:37.680 --> 00:36:39.609
You need not tell people that, “You are
evil!

214
00:36:39.609 --> 00:36:43.459
You are bad!“, or anything – but just
“Get out of Sahaja Yoga!”

215
00:36:43.459 --> 00:36:44.519
Have nothing to do with them.

216
00:36:44.519 --> 00:36:45.930
You should say, “We are sorry.

217
00:36:45.930 --> 00:36:47.859
We can’t to anything about it.

218
00:36:47.859 --> 00:36:48.999
You do what you like.

219
00:36:48.999 --> 00:36:51.889
It’s not our responsibility.”

220
00:36:51.889 --> 00:36:58.190
And there you should not be meek, you should
not feel embarrassed or delicate about it.

221
00:36:58.190 --> 00:37:00.279
Tell them off, “Nothing doing.

222
00:37:00.279 --> 00:37:07.960
We cannot help you here, we are sorry, you
work it out yourself.”

223
00:37:07.960 --> 00:37:16.800
Because this light is a light which nourishes
you and strengthens you.

224
00:37:16.800 --> 00:37:22.700
The light of the Spirit must give you that
strength within you.

225
00:37:22.700 --> 00:37:25.670
You become a strong personality.

226
00:37:25.670 --> 00:37:35.529
You become a personality which can withstand
lots of things, even crucifixion, but it can

227
00:37:35.529 --> 00:37:37.619
also fight.

228
00:37:39.370 --> 00:37:44.720
It has all the qualities built within itself.

229
00:37:44.720 --> 00:37:47.899
Like a person who has a temper.

230
00:37:47.899 --> 00:37:48.899
No!

231
00:37:48.899 --> 00:37:51.389
It’s not a very good person to be, with
temper.

232
00:37:51.389 --> 00:37:54.999
It’s not good for a Sahaja Yogi to have
temper.

233
00:37:54.999 --> 00:38:01.320
But if somebody says something to you against
your Mother, you have to have temper.

234
00:38:01.320 --> 00:38:05.029
That’s the place we have to use temper.

235
00:38:05.029 --> 00:38:09.050
You can box that person, doesn’t matter.

236
00:38:12.370 --> 00:38:15.690
Ganesha will be just standing behind
you.

237
00:38:16.470 --> 00:38:21.870
And Hanumana will be in front.

238
00:38:21.870 --> 00:38:28.259
If you box him once, Hanumana will
box him ten times.

239
00:38:28.259 --> 00:38:35.649
So that time the anger has meaning.

240
00:38:37.578 --> 00:38:45.619
Now, people say, one should not have greed
in life.

241
00:38:45.619 --> 00:38:52.499
Yes, one should not have greed, but if you
have got greed for vibrations it’s a very

242
00:38:52.499 --> 00:38:54.160
good thing.

243
00:38:54.160 --> 00:38:57.019
You should be very greedy about vibrations.

244
00:38:57.019 --> 00:39:02.869
Wherever you get vibrations, you must rush
and try to get more vibrations.

245
00:39:02.869 --> 00:39:09.720
Greed is alright, you should have that greed
within yourself.

246
00:39:09.720 --> 00:39:16.790
If you don’t have that greed, how will you
be able to overcome the other attractions?

247
00:39:16.870 --> 00:39:21.599
It is very surprising, I always wonder about
human beings – which I’ve never been able

248
00:39:21.599 --> 00:39:24.450
to understand Myself.

249
00:39:28.970 --> 00:39:35.800
That, when it comes to hatred they
are the best!

250
00:39:35.800 --> 00:39:44.560
If they want to hate someone then you can
make them sacrifice everything that they have.

251
00:39:44.560 --> 00:39:50.560
Under the name of God, under the name of nation,
under the name of anything whatever you want.

252
00:39:50.560 --> 00:39:53.740
You just have to say that, “We have to hate
someone.”

253
00:39:53.740 --> 00:40:00.570
Immediately they’ll gather around, they’ll
pass trough all kinds of ordeals, sacrifice

254
00:40:00.570 --> 00:40:09.639
everything, go to jails, they will kill themselves,
commit suicides – just if you tell them,

255
00:40:09.639 --> 00:40:12.239
“We hate someone.”

256
00:40:12.239 --> 00:40:18.999
Or else you have to say that, “We are a
great nation, something very big and, these

257
00:40:18.999 --> 00:40:24.420
are bad nations – so we have to fight.”

258
00:40:24.420 --> 00:40:30.219
They will do.

259
00:40:30.219 --> 00:40:37.989
It is very surprising that, even when it comes
to political revolutions and for their political

260
00:40:37.989 --> 00:40:45.599
freedom, they can go to any limit of sacrifices.

261
00:40:45.599 --> 00:40:47.889
The other day I was watching Lenin’s fight.

262
00:40:47.889 --> 00:40:49.180
I was amazed!

263
00:40:49.180 --> 00:40:57.219
This single man Lenin, who was always in the
exile used to only write, “We have to fight,

264
00:40:57.219 --> 00:40:59.570
we have to get this, we have to do that.”

265
00:40:59.570 --> 00:41:06.399
Though he was a realised soul, but still he
didn’t write about spirituality, he wrote

266
00:41:06.399 --> 00:41:13.509
about political struggle, and three times
there was an upsurge and thousands and thousands

267
00:41:13.509 --> 00:41:23.680
of people you find in every place being killed
– just like that.

268
00:41:23.680 --> 00:41:24.680
It is very surprising.

269
00:41:24.680 --> 00:41:32.730
Now, don’t fan, you see, while I am talking
you should not fan, you know, it disturbs.

270
00:41:32.730 --> 00:41:37.660
Pay full attention; pay full attention, is
important.

271
00:41:37.660 --> 00:41:44.410
Because if you do not pay attention, others
will look at you, and their attention will

272
00:41:44.410 --> 00:41:45.410
be spoiled.

273
00:41:45.410 --> 00:41:53.190
Now this one was so dedicated, even little
children and wives and pregnant women and

274
00:41:53.190 --> 00:41:58.239
so many men were killed in a lot like that.

275
00:41:58.239 --> 00:42:04.029
Again they rose, again they rose three times,
and the fourth time they were successful.

276
00:42:06.670 --> 00:42:08.070
For what?

277
00:42:08.150 --> 00:42:10.769
For a political achievement.

278
00:42:10.769 --> 00:42:15.519
We did that in India, too.

279
00:42:15.519 --> 00:42:20.550
People gave up everything that they have,
their houses, families – everything they

280
00:42:20.550 --> 00:42:22.550
gave up.

281
00:42:22.550 --> 00:42:29.139
Even for fake gurus people have spent so much
money, they have done so much, given up everything,

282
00:42:29.139 --> 00:42:33.660
sold their houses, put their children into
trouble, got into trouble – everything they

283
00:42:33.660 --> 00:42:34.790
did.

284
00:42:34.790 --> 00:42:50.120
But for the right thing, the wisest thing,
the only great thing that has to happen is

285
00:42:50.200 --> 00:42:59.589
Sahaja Yoga – where comfort is pouring on
us all the time, where all kinds of joy is

286
00:42:59.589 --> 00:43:11.040
pouring on us, where everything is being smoothed
out for you – people become so fond of comfort,

287
00:43:11.040 --> 00:43:19.209
and this and that, that the slightest sacrifice
they can’t understand.

288
00:43:19.209 --> 00:43:24.299
They’ll come with problems about their wives,
about their children, about their husbands

289
00:43:24.299 --> 00:43:25.499
– everything solved.

290
00:43:25.499 --> 00:43:28.820
Now this goes on and on and on and on.

291
00:43:28.820 --> 00:43:30.060
Solve them!

292
00:43:30.060 --> 00:43:31.149
Finish them off!

293
00:43:31.149 --> 00:43:33.199
Cut them short!

294
00:43:33.199 --> 00:43:37.410
You have to spread Sahaja Yoga!

295
00:43:37.410 --> 00:43:42.829
You have to sacrifice some time, you have
to sacrifice some money also.

296
00:43:42.829 --> 00:43:47.899
Who is going to work it out?

297
00:43:47.899 --> 00:43:56.990
Nobody is going to kill you, as people were
killed in Russia, or in Germany, or in Poland.

298
00:43:56.990 --> 00:44:01.709
Nobody is going to take away your children
or to take away your money, or anything – no

299
00:44:01.709 --> 00:44:05.790
one wants it.

300
00:44:05.790 --> 00:44:13.730
But this light in your hand has to be burnt
with the true desire, the pure desire within

301
00:44:13.730 --> 00:44:17.560
you, is the Kundalini.

302
00:44:17.560 --> 00:44:25.749
That is the wick, that is the one has to be
kept absolutely nourished.

303
00:44:25.749 --> 00:44:29.410
And that is where sahaja yogis fail.

304
00:44:29.410 --> 00:44:32.249
People don’t want to leave Sahaja Yoga.

305
00:44:32.249 --> 00:44:34.170
Even if you tell them, “Please go away,
we can’t help!”

306
00:44:34.250 --> 00:44:35.590
– “No, no, no, I cannot leave Sahaja Yoga.”

307
00:44:35.670 --> 00:44:36.370
– “Why?”

308
00:44:36.450 --> 00:44:40.550
Because is a place of enjoyment.

309
00:44:40.633 --> 00:44:48.099
But it would be something different from human
beings, because human beings, if a human being

310
00:44:48.099 --> 00:44:56.170
gets a bottle of wine he’ll call ten more
to enjoy it.

311
00:44:56.170 --> 00:45:03.170
If a dog gets something to eat he’ll call
other dogs to eat it.

312
00:45:03.170 --> 00:45:07.790
If a crow gets something to eat he’ll call
other crows to eat it.

313
00:45:07.790 --> 00:45:10.379
Naturally built within them.

314
00:45:10.379 --> 00:45:12.979
Same with human beings.

315
00:45:12.979 --> 00:45:19.759
But when it comes to Sahaja Yoga we are not
that tenacious about it.

316
00:45:19.759 --> 00:45:24.449
We have to tell all our relations, “We are
Sahaja Yogis, and this is the religion of

317
00:45:24.449 --> 00:45:28.010
within, and this is what it is – if you
don’t want to follow I have nothing to do

318
00:45:28.090 --> 00:45:29.390
with you.

319
00:45:29.470 --> 00:45:30.890
Why don’t you follow it?”

320
00:45:30.970 --> 00:45:35.070
Everybody has got relations.

321
00:45:36.070 --> 00:45:42.310
So on a Diwali day, when we were talking about
our light, what are we going to do with this

322
00:45:42.310 --> 00:45:43.310
light?

323
00:45:43.310 --> 00:45:46.399
Are we going to use it only for our own purpose?

324
00:45:46.399 --> 00:45:57.969
Christ has said, you don’t put the light
under a – what you call it? – measure.

325
00:45:57.969 --> 00:46:03.099
You don’t put it under a measure.

326
00:46:03.099 --> 00:46:05.290
You put it on a table.

327
00:46:05.370 --> 00:46:09.670
We all have to come out in the public, we
have to find out ways and methods.

328
00:46:09.670 --> 00:46:15.730
It’s not only the leaders, everybody has
to work it out what we can do to spread Sahaja

329
00:46:15.730 --> 00:46:16.730
Yoga.

330
00:46:16.730 --> 00:46:20.660
In every place you go: how can we give Sahaja
Yoga?

331
00:46:20.660 --> 00:46:25.930
Of course I don’t want you to change your
dresses – but you can carry big badges.

332
00:46:25.930 --> 00:46:26.930
People will ask you.

333
00:46:26.930 --> 00:46:33.940
You should say, “Yes, this is the person
who has given us peace, joy and happiness.”

334
00:46:33.940 --> 00:46:38.879
Start talking like that, go to the markets,
go to public places.

335
00:46:38.879 --> 00:46:48.180
I go to market just to spread vibrations – you
all have to do that, otherwise you will have

336
00:46:48.180 --> 00:46:52.879
the Sahaja Yoga enjoyment to yourself , but
unless and until you share it you are not

337
00:46:52.879 --> 00:46:54.649
going to enjoy it fully.

338
00:46:54.649 --> 00:46:56.379
Look at Me.

339
00:46:56.379 --> 00:47:00.810
I have all the vibrations of the world.

340
00:47:00.810 --> 00:47:09.270
I have everything, I should be
such a self-contented person, sitting at home

341
00:47:09.270 --> 00:47:13.910
– in meditation.

342
00:47:15.670 --> 00:47:19.620
At this age, why should I travel
after all?

343
00:47:20.670 --> 00:47:26.730
I am the Adi Shakti – why should
I worry of making everybody such a powerful

344
00:47:26.730 --> 00:47:28.649
shakti people?

345
00:47:28.649 --> 00:47:32.160
There’s no need.

346
00:47:32.160 --> 00:47:41.972
I should enjoy My powers, I can, but I cannot.

347
00:47:41.972 --> 00:47:43.930
I have to work hard.

348
00:47:43.930 --> 00:47:48.440
I give the maximum time to Sahaja Yoga, than
any one of you can give.

349
00:47:48.440 --> 00:47:53.380
I have a family, I have got My husband.

350
00:47:53.380 --> 00:47:56.080
He has a life which is very, very busy life.

351
00:47:56.080 --> 00:47:57.770
I’ve got grandchildren.

352
00:47:57.770 --> 00:48:00.210
I give the maximum time.

353
00:48:00.210 --> 00:48:04.790
Now see, from here to Rome, then to France,
then to Spain.

354
00:48:04.790 --> 00:48:08.220
You all are having just a relay race.

355
00:48:08.220 --> 00:48:11.990
Alright, I am here – Italians are having
a little strain.

356
00:48:12.070 --> 00:48:13.370
Then they will relax!

357
00:48:13.450 --> 00:48:19.190
“Now alright…”

358
00:48:20.790 --> 00:48:23.950
Then, what do I do?

359
00:48:23.950 --> 00:48:28.380
All the year round I am going from places
to places…travelling.

360
00:48:28.380 --> 00:48:33.420
And when I have everything.

361
00:48:33.420 --> 00:48:44.750
Can you think of a rich man who is busy distributing
all the wealth he has, while the others take

362
00:48:44.750 --> 00:48:47.150
time to take it?

363
00:48:47.150 --> 00:48:49.960
That is what it is.

364
00:48:49.960 --> 00:48:58.880
So I have to tell you that you have to come
in a new dimension of your enthusiasm.

365
00:48:58.880 --> 00:49:03.150
Sahaja Yoga is not for our enjoyment alone.

366
00:49:03.150 --> 00:49:04.890
“We are saints,” so what!

367
00:49:04.890 --> 00:49:05.980
For what?

368
00:49:05.980 --> 00:49:08.270
For what you are made saints?

369
00:49:08.270 --> 00:49:12.720
It’s not that the men should only do, or
women should do, or this one should do, or

370
00:49:12.720 --> 00:49:14.560
that one should do.

371
00:49:14.560 --> 00:49:20.970
Don’t get involved into these temptations.

372
00:49:20.970 --> 00:49:27.600
There are thirteen temptations, which came
out of the churning.

373
00:49:27.600 --> 00:49:36.180
The fourteenth one was a big hunter to neutralise
all the thirteen.

374
00:49:38.446 --> 00:49:44.500
Not that Sahaja Yoga wants to tempt anyone,
but they become temptations because they are

375
00:49:44.500 --> 00:49:49.030
blessings to you, and blessings you start
using as temptations.

376
00:49:49.030 --> 00:50:01.840
Now, for anybody, to have such a temptation
would be more like a horse, which has to go

377
00:50:01.840 --> 00:50:09.720
to the south or to the north, is standing
and eating the grass.

378
00:50:09.720 --> 00:50:16.250
You have to move, movement is the point, you
have to move from places to places, you have

379
00:50:16.250 --> 00:50:20.790
to go from villages to villages, you have
to go from houses to houses.

380
00:50:20.790 --> 00:50:23.470
This message has to spread.

381
00:50:23.470 --> 00:50:28.920
Christ’s twelve disciples only – how much
religion they have created?

382
00:50:28.920 --> 00:50:34.430
Of course, it’s of no use, but still!

383
00:50:34.430 --> 00:50:37.800
You are going to give something so substantial
and so great.

384
00:50:37.800 --> 00:50:41.030
But when you tell them, then the way you tell
them is important.

385
00:50:41.030 --> 00:50:47.740
The way you assert is important.

386
00:50:47.740 --> 00:50:51.840
I don’t mind from today – you can tell
them what I am.

387
00:50:51.840 --> 00:50:53.080
Doesn’t matter.

388
00:50:53.080 --> 00:50:54.650
How long are we going to hide it?

389
00:50:54.650 --> 00:50:59.380
You better tell them that, “She is such
and such, it’s written in the Bible, She

390
00:50:59.380 --> 00:51:00.970
is such and such – we have found it.

391
00:51:00.970 --> 00:51:04.180
If you don’t want to see it, don’t see
it – but it is so.”

392
00:51:04.180 --> 00:51:14.760
Let’s have that determination and let’s
have that kind of a outspokenness.

393
00:51:14.760 --> 00:51:17.100
Look at these horrible politicians.

394
00:51:17.100 --> 00:51:23.530
They say, “I believe that there should be
some people who should be rich, the rest should

395
00:51:23.530 --> 00:51:24.530
be poor.

396
00:51:24.530 --> 00:51:26.230
I believe.

397
00:51:26.230 --> 00:51:28.730
I believe in this and I believe in that.”

398
00:51:28.730 --> 00:51:30.270
What about you?

399
00:51:30.270 --> 00:51:34.640
You do not only believe, but you know for
definite!

400
00:51:34.640 --> 00:51:45.800
And that’s what should be decided on a Diwali
day that by next Diwali we have to get many,

401
00:51:45.800 --> 00:51:47.430
many people for Sahaja Yoga.

402
00:51:47.430 --> 00:51:52.870
But when I speak, many people told Me that
they think I am not speaking to them [but]

403
00:51:52.870 --> 00:51:55.680
to somebody else.

404
00:51:55.680 --> 00:52:00.800
You should see to the people who are working
harder than you for Sahaja Yoga; who are involved

405
00:52:00.800 --> 00:52:05.710
more in Sahaja Yoga; those who are achieving
more in Sahaja Yoga – not the people who

406
00:52:05.710 --> 00:52:08.100
have done nothing.

407
00:52:08.100 --> 00:52:11.460
You can see Me.

408
00:52:16.370 --> 00:52:17.780
What are we doing?

409
00:52:17.780 --> 00:52:21.280
You should think about it.

410
00:52:21.280 --> 00:52:24.980
Where are we?

411
00:52:24.980 --> 00:52:29.010
This is the most important period.

412
00:52:29.010 --> 00:52:33.720
At the most, in Europe, I will be for five
years more, at the most.

413
00:52:33.720 --> 00:52:40.650
Do you think I’ll be travelling after seventy
years of age?

414
00:52:40.650 --> 00:52:43.690
No.

415
00:52:43.690 --> 00:52:48.970
So this is such an important time when I am
here, then I could meet people, I could talk

416
00:52:48.970 --> 00:52:51.780
to them, I can help you a lot.

417
00:52:51.780 --> 00:52:54.330
In these five years you have to achieve something.

418
00:52:54.330 --> 00:52:59.860
And you have to take a jump and give a speed
to yourself.

419
00:52:59.860 --> 00:53:06.460
Otherwise this is a very important time, will
be lost by all your fellow men.

420
00:53:06.460 --> 00:53:08.890
Like the other day we had program.

421
00:53:08.890 --> 00:53:13.760
I’ll tell you a practical side: now what,
I would do [is] take the addresses of all

422
00:53:13.760 --> 00:53:21.620
the people who got realisation, take it down,
write to them, go and see them, meet them.

423
00:53:21.620 --> 00:53:24.540
[Find out] what has happened, why didn’t
they come.

424
00:53:24.540 --> 00:53:31.300
Then make a statement, why people didn’t
come, what happened, why is he not coming.

425
00:53:31.300 --> 00:53:34.370
Write to them all the time.

426
00:53:34.370 --> 00:53:39.640
See you’ll be surprised if you take one
copy of ‘Reader’s Digest‘ (Magazine),

427
00:53:39.640 --> 00:53:42.720
only once – make a mistake.

428
00:53:42.720 --> 00:53:50.790
– they go on sending you so many
types of things, you know?

429
00:53:50.790 --> 00:53:56.800
You will get this present, you’ll
get – this is a car free for you, this thing

430
00:53:56.800 --> 00:53:57.800
for you.

431
00:53:57.800 --> 00:53:58.800
Who wants it?

432
00:53:58.800 --> 00:53:59.860
But they go on sending.

433
00:53:59.860 --> 00:54:02.370
I have written to them, “Don’t send Me
anything.

434
00:54:02.370 --> 00:54:03.370
I don’t want any car – nothing.

435
00:54:03.370 --> 00:54:07.070
You just send Me Reader’s Digest, thank
you very much.

436
00:54:07.070 --> 00:54:08.240
I’m not a lucky person.

437
00:54:08.320 --> 00:54:09.560
Please don’t send.”

438
00:54:09.640 --> 00:54:15.610
Still they are sending!

439
00:54:17.200 --> 00:54:21.090
In this way you must write to them all the
time, “Why are you not coming to Mother?

440
00:54:21.090 --> 00:54:23.150
Why you are not coming to Sahaja Yoga?

441
00:54:23.150 --> 00:54:26.950
Sahaja Yoga is so important, it has given
me so much, why don’t you want to have it?”

442
00:54:26.950 --> 00:54:30.810
You must show that earnestness within you.

443
00:54:30.810 --> 00:54:36.240
And if you do not show that earnestness – take
it in a mundane way, “Alright, it’s going

444
00:54:36.240 --> 00:54:39.970
well, this, that, is good, alright, this is
improving, that is.”

445
00:54:39.970 --> 00:54:42.390
That’s not the way you are going to work
it out!

446
00:54:42.470 --> 00:54:45.869
Once I go to India I know in India it will
take no time.

447
00:54:45.949 --> 00:54:52.420
India will work out very fast.

448
00:54:52.420 --> 00:55:01.370
And you have to book your seats in the heaven,
that’s very important.

449
00:55:01.370 --> 00:55:08.760
I mean, even for an aeroplane you have to
book a seat; then what about heaven?

450
00:55:09.770 --> 00:55:12.640
And so many have to book the seats.

451
00:55:12.640 --> 00:55:18.720
If all Indians are sitting there, what will
you do?

452
00:55:22.630 --> 00:55:31.260
So with this joy, with this happiness, with
this light on our face, with this beauty of

453
00:55:31.260 --> 00:55:35.250
enlightenment you are all gurus.

454
00:55:35.250 --> 00:55:39.240
Imagine, these useless [false] gurus know
nothing, their Kundalini is not awakened,

455
00:55:39.240 --> 00:55:43.030
nothing of that kind – and how much they
have built up their empires after empires.

456
00:55:43.030 --> 00:55:49.970
I don’t say that you build up empires, no,
not that way, but why not build up at least

457
00:55:49.970 --> 00:55:58.040
a hut to show that you have achieved something
and it has to be done.

458
00:55:58.040 --> 00:56:02.240
Talk to everyone in your office, in your this
thing, not to feel shy.

459
00:56:02.240 --> 00:56:06.490
I have seen people put up these horrible peoples’
photographs everywhere.

460
00:56:06.490 --> 00:56:11.180
In their office you go, you find them; in
the buses you find them; everywhere they are

461
00:56:11.180 --> 00:56:12.180
hanging.

462
00:56:12.180 --> 00:56:14.700
Why not My photograph?

463
00:56:14.700 --> 00:56:20.090
So the curiosity is there, people will ask
you, you tell them – it will work out.

464
00:56:20.090 --> 00:56:23.260
The best thing is working out in Italy, surprisingly.

465
00:56:23.260 --> 00:56:28.480
And it will go ahead, because we found some
very good people and you should try to find

466
00:56:28.480 --> 00:56:30.800
out.

467
00:56:30.800 --> 00:56:34.790
Such people who are around – get after them
and work it out.

468
00:56:34.790 --> 00:56:38.910
But don’t go to wrong people, must use your
discretion.

469
00:56:38.910 --> 00:56:43.810
You know how these [false] gurus work – is
very important.

470
00:56:43.810 --> 00:56:49.140
My brother was telling Me that a lady from
this Muktananda – now the Muktananda is

471
00:56:49.140 --> 00:56:54.010
not there, there is another American girl,
American-styled Indian girl.

472
00:56:54.010 --> 00:57:01.510
So, this Muktananda lady (disciple), one English
lady came to his house, My brother’s house

473
00:57:01.510 --> 00:57:04.960
– and she was very sweet, “I want to see
you, Sir,” – this, that.

474
00:57:04.960 --> 00:57:06.430
And she saw My photograph.

475
00:57:06.430 --> 00:57:08.830
So she said, “What is this Mataji doing
here?”

476
00:57:08.830 --> 00:57:09.830
He said, “Why?

477
00:57:09.830 --> 00:57:11.520
She is my sister.”

478
00:57:11.520 --> 00:57:15.490
She just bundled up everything and ran away.

479
00:57:15.570 --> 00:57:19.030
So My brother called her, “Please, come
along, sit down, sit down.

480
00:57:19.030 --> 00:57:20.030
What do you do?”

481
00:57:20.030 --> 00:57:25.160
She said, “No Sir, we see – we always
go and meet all the important people of the

482
00:57:25.160 --> 00:57:27.970
city, talk to them about it.”

483
00:57:27.970 --> 00:57:30.500
He said, “Yes.”

484
00:57:30.500 --> 00:57:33.830
And all the judges’ names were on the list.

485
00:57:33.830 --> 00:57:36.960
Immediately My brother took the telephone
and told them, “Have nothing to do with

486
00:57:36.960 --> 00:57:39.320
this woman!”

487
00:57:39.320 --> 00:57:43.050
But this is what it is.

488
00:57:43.050 --> 00:57:45.380
You should find out how to approach people.

489
00:57:45.380 --> 00:57:49.220
When I am there, there are – say – 200
people.

490
00:57:49.220 --> 00:57:50.960
When I go away, there are only 2 people.

491
00:57:50.960 --> 00:57:51.960
Why?

492
00:57:51.960 --> 00:57:52.960
What is the matter?

493
00:57:52.960 --> 00:57:55.410
Why they go away?

494
00:57:55.410 --> 00:57:58.260
There must be some reason.

495
00:57:58.260 --> 00:58:01.490
They don’t know Me.

496
00:58:01.490 --> 00:58:03.940
At least get their addresses.

497
00:58:03.940 --> 00:58:05.740
Find out who are these people.

498
00:58:05.740 --> 00:58:11.530
There’s no harm in getting their addresses
and finding out who they are.

499
00:58:11.530 --> 00:58:16.210
Then put them on the list and go on sending
letters to them, if not so much like Reader’s

500
00:58:16.290 --> 00:58:22.930
Digest, but something.

501
00:58:22.930 --> 00:58:28.170
When you will start sending letters to them,
you will be entered into their ignorance.

502
00:58:28.170 --> 00:58:31.070
The light will go in.

503
00:58:31.070 --> 00:58:35.280
Through your movement, your attention, the
light will go.

504
00:58:35.280 --> 00:58:39.130
You don’t know your attention, how powerful
it is.

505
00:58:39.130 --> 00:58:42.820
Once you start paying attention to them, the
light will pass through them.

506
00:58:42.820 --> 00:58:46.990
If not today, tomorrow they’ll come round.

507
00:58:46.990 --> 00:58:51.770
You can also send My photograph, “Try on
the photograph, this is the photograph, you

508
00:58:51.770 --> 00:58:53.880
came to the program, we are very happy.”

509
00:58:53.880 --> 00:58:59.370
Now if the follow-on doesn’t work out, try
this thing.

510
00:58:59.370 --> 00:59:06.370
And that’s the best way you can achieve
sometimes, but it is for you to think and

511
00:59:06.370 --> 00:59:10.590
understand – because you are human beings
and you know human beings.

512
00:59:10.590 --> 00:59:17.130
You just put yourself in the position of another
person – what would have appealed to you?

513
00:59:22.226 --> 00:59:27.100
There’s another thing I feel that people
should write books about Me.

514
00:59:27.100 --> 00:59:28.100
There’s no harm.

515
00:59:28.100 --> 00:59:32.230
But about Me, write the book about Me.

516
00:59:32.230 --> 00:59:37.510
But some people, who have a name, who have
in the society some name, who will be taken

517
00:59:37.510 --> 00:59:43.450
up seriously – they can write a book about
Me.

518
00:59:43.450 --> 00:59:47.660
They write books about everyone, why can’t
you write a book about Me?

519
00:59:47.660 --> 00:59:52.110
Not about, you can write about Sahaja Yoga
in it – of course, but you can write about

520
00:59:52.110 --> 00:59:53.110
Me.

521
00:59:53.110 --> 00:59:57.710
Telling people of such and such person is
there, and this is the solution, this is the

522
00:59:57.710 --> 00:59:58.710
hope.

523
00:59:58.710 --> 00:59:59.710
Why not?

524
00:59:59.710 --> 01:00:03.500
They write about all these horrible gurus,
why can’t you write about Me?

525
01:00:03.500 --> 01:00:08.120
But the person has to be a well known person.

526
01:00:08.120 --> 01:00:16.470
Now supposing you write a book, somebody else
can publish in his name – if you are a good

527
01:00:16.470 --> 01:00:17.470
writer.

528
01:00:17.470 --> 01:00:19.760
Somebody else can edit it and publish it.

529
01:00:19.760 --> 01:00:21.660
We can do that way.

530
01:00:21.660 --> 01:00:27.660
There are so many ways and methods by which
you can bring to the notice of the people

531
01:00:27.660 --> 01:00:29.140
that this is Sahaja Yoga.

532
01:00:29.140 --> 01:00:32.230
How many people know about Sahaja Yoga?

533
01:00:32.230 --> 01:00:37.130
A person comes out of jail, from India, walks
out and here it is.

534
01:00:37.130 --> 01:00:46.870
Very well known ‘guru’ sitting in some
corner of some dirty lane in America somewhere,

535
01:00:46.870 --> 01:00:48.270
and is a very well known person.

536
01:00:48.270 --> 01:00:51.470
They are all very well known – how?

537
01:01:00.400 --> 01:01:05.650
And it is not always that these things are
done through money, they are done through

538
01:01:05.650 --> 01:01:10.960
people doing their own deliberation.

539
01:01:10.960 --> 01:01:15.880
But these deliberations may be mesmerising,
bhootish, I agree.

540
01:01:15.880 --> 01:01:20.850
I do understand that you are free people,
to do what you like, but in your freedom you

541
01:01:20.850 --> 01:01:23.030
have to realise.

542
01:01:23.030 --> 01:01:27.840
And this is what today you all have to decide
that this is the light we have got, this has

543
01:01:27.840 --> 01:01:35.280
to be made into a beacon, not just a light,
a tinted light like that; what’s the use?

544
01:01:35.280 --> 01:01:39.290
We have to be like a beautiful tower of light.

545
01:01:41.241 --> 01:01:44.640
Like a lighthouse.

546
01:01:44.640 --> 01:01:48.520
And everybody should work it out within and
without.

547
01:01:48.520 --> 01:01:51.420
Within though you have worked out, without
you must work now.

548
01:01:51.420 --> 01:01:55.980
And secondly there’s a deepawali, it is
not only one light.

549
01:01:55.980 --> 01:01:59.590
So we have to be all collective, try to get
to collective life.

550
01:01:59.590 --> 01:02:04.750
Whenever it is possible, try to attend all
that is collective; try to be there, where

551
01:02:04.750 --> 01:02:05.950
there is collective happenings.

552
01:02:05.950 --> 01:02:11.720
There, where it is collective, this source
of energy flows better.

553
01:02:13.970 --> 01:02:16.060
May God bless you all!

